    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 1020 PM MDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near Madrid, or near Grant, moving east at 15 mph. HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 50 mph and penny size hail. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible. This strong thunderstorm will be near... Madrid around 1025 PM MDT. Other locations impacted by this storm include Grainton. This includes Highway 61 between mile markers 55 and 68.",
